    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_0bf5480b-4501-40a5-8baf-65ff7d4a98f4\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_722f4ab6-2168-489c-bdfc-855935fd608f\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">LOAD SHEDDING</text><text id=\"svg_e749e1af-fe02-4127-bdc9-f42c40a9f3bc\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Switch a unit to SHED to cut its power. The light shows the real state: green = running, red = shed / off. A unit switched back on restarts after a 3 s lock-out.</text><g id=\"HXB_6566c860-6846-41ec-af9d-497ac5935ee6\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_064b701d-7e93-43a3-a3c0-fe40a0d8da96\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_ffe47498-1aaf-4a44-a813-574b92c0d11b\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_f2579b5f-8b2a-4284-a688-c781c90d610d\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_dab6c4fd-eab1-4128-8a47-aaf919b9a21c\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_6277fdaa-31ff-4a50-9cd6-4572fc3801b0\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_d39b0fc1-7365-4819-a2f3-0f2e467cb4b1\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_304e09fd-776c-432b-96ad-201f130fab2d\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_3dab4c85-7417-4bdb-b158-5a053b0040d0\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_53514b90-abdc-4527-91e1-fafe951fa4bb\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_0b61fa1c-afdf-4ae9-b68c-d68997b0fc71\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_fb080e2f-1d6c-4b2c-8077-e5d1833c6126\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Mechanism setup</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><rect id=\"svg_8d4796df-903e-4aab-93e8-e65a699d67bc\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_157b78eb-8ada-4032-9006-4aa5b9455d01\" x=\"36\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">TOTAL POWER (kW)</text><g id=\"VAL_c04fc320-95bd-4440-a9a7-827d2dea00f2\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"start\"><text id=\"VAL_d3436b5a-e9e8-4e2c-8530-ea8820c02cd2\" x=\"36\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">#0.0</text></g><rect id=\"svg_5ffcd3d0-2fdf-4622-8e75-aa8af65a146c\" x=\"413\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_dfb466fe-a549-479d-bce4-d37c89ecd424\" x