    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_3d5784f5-7d2b-4d86-837a-ec1a52fd2b1f\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_ae4df5c5-af41-44a3-bfed-29987573730a\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">MECHANISM SETUP</text><g id=\"HXB_15631467-96c2-4dc3-9d21-452f69166efe\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_06d6a4fb-045d-4dae-a4a9-e18082669a5f\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_aa8f3ba5-5979-412d-830b-7632c186d494\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_be72ddb5-aede-4687-8efe-ff413ff8fd50\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_faeb4641-1a90-47ec-afd5-b70d207b22e3\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_b139f8be-61f2-4de7-96a5-e6d57ae05105\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_33c8220d-0ac7-4f5b-876c-bd85fb8a959b\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_c05d556b-328e-45cf-b662-85fcdae6d94b\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_28c6f309-072f-4e4a-841e-26e5cded23bc\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_37ecacea-1c67-4824-b7b4-23830f9578f9\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_aff1601f-9cf4-4a92-aa72-91c40d5938d7\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_6a5e9b34-3bcf-4449-84e9-b51f96bdd4b8\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Load shedding</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_59c8f560-b8b2-48f2-906c-73d9bef87791\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Adjust the simulated mechanisms; every axis follows the virtual master axis (position = ratio \u00d7 master + phase + cam).</text><rect id=\"svg_d9351c28-ccc8-418a-aa20-975928151730\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"1560\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_d2bdd254-7d39-482e-a719-402699cf3e42\" x=\"40\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Master speed (rpm)</text><g id=\"HXI_1dbe3950-5647-4127-a3c7-7c064f391335\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_8b88079b-d9d8-4882-a8d6-73b63341975b\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_79d43568-e95e-4a25-bf4d-98a5a0f6278a\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_55559ff2-60dc-4e4b-9c72-849dcf2b3424\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_256836b3-ec8f-4c21-b24b-f5bd6542f874\" x=\"310\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Actual</text><g id=\"VAL_9a986cdd-f4a9-4994-8811-6aac1fa18817\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\"><text id=\"VAL_73359378-832c-43d6-bbb6-136ef616a862\" x=\"400\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">###0.0</text></g><g id=\"HXB_3501be8b-93b7-4f07-9048-8a842c6856cb\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_6104acdb-daf5-4292-9a94-f594228d7ff7\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#27ae60\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_12e9a1c4-dddd-43bb-b428-43741cce6be4\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_075805e7-96af-4959-95ac-19eb7ddb98f3\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #27ae60; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">RUN</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_d7b2a724-c897-4e52-970f-751c72591750\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_8527c717-f408-430c-8572-3510a582ac4a\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_5101ce3d-a2d0-4722-b10e-a48ee824d345\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_acc16f59-160e-4d38-8412-198de079cdbe\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #c0392b; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">STOP</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_a7768721-8e24-4ca5-b9ee-48b5de22f0d8\" x=\"40\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Fault injection: raise Imbalance / Looseness / BearingWear / Misalignment (0 = healthy \u2026 1 = severe) and watch the Overview.</text><rect id=\"svg_031ffdb3-b1e0-4926-abb3-21b1e38cc38d\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"300\" height=\"508\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect id=\"svg_327f0e1b-68dd-4612-a5fb-d4681e62797b\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"6\" height=\"508\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_0a205a8e-56ac-46db-9477-a15c819dc680\" x=\"40\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">AXIS 1</text><text id=\"svg_59afe3c8-c379-4fb2-b988-ace594d273a3\" x=\"40\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Enabled (1/0)</text><g id=\"HXI_eac30b08-b529-4082-923e-15a6cb49082d\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_c069ecbc-5314-4ffb-b611-296be89f1583\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_201e05d9-6b15-4953-8be2-cd070a0fe931\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_c6298c88-f024-4b0b-8651-c098c0baf1a0\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_b0303773-9654-437f-89b6-b53de9c3133d\" x=\"40\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Gear ratio<